   <title>Male infertility is &#039;grossly underreported&#039;</title>
   <link>https://www.dw.com/en/male-infertility-is-grossly-underreported/a-79368722?maca=en-rss_en_science-22531-xml-mrss</link>
   <description>It&#039;s not all on women anymore — doctors do test men for sperm count and motility. But still too few men get checked, possibly due to a misconception that a healthy sex life means healthy sperm. Spoiler: It doesn&#039;t.</description>
